### 1. 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "아이스 아메리카노",
  "price": 4500,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/coffee.jpg"
}

### 2. 상품 조회 (1번)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 3. 없는 상품 조회 (99번)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/99